# What the check image copies from the repo root: an allow-list of what the
# checks need, so local notes, editor and agent settings, secrets and other
# untracked files in a checkout never reach an image layer.
*
!Makefile
!extension
!frontend
!tests
!test-fixtures
!scripts/container/install-zig.sh

# Within those: dependencies, build output and anything local.
**/node_modules
**/.zig-cache
**/zig-out
**/zig-pkg
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
frontend/playwright-report
frontend/test-results
frontend/bundle-stats.html
frontend/.husky
test-fixtures/Backups
**/*.rpp-bak
**/*.RPP-bak
**/*.rpp-undo
**/*.RPP-UNDO
**/*.reapeaks
**/*.rk
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.local
**/*.local.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
